{"id":"vod_md_4782","vodId":"4782","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"强风吹拂","name_cn":"强风吹拂","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"23集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230912-1/90752168d610726edcc6bd3277da89f7.jpg"},"summary":"藏原走（大冢刚央 配音）是一名性格非常内向的大学一年级男生，不善言辞的他总是习惯用跑步来抒发内心里的情感波动。一天深夜，正在跑步的阿走遇见了名叫清濑灰二（丰永利行 配音）的男子，这个散发着独特魅力的男人主动向阿走搭话，并且向阿走介绍了他所居住的名为竹青庄的公寓。就这样，阿走在半推半就之下成为了竹青庄的第10名住户。虽然日常打打闹闹但相互非常信赖的城太郎兄弟、被称之为神童，但阿走却觉得他有些古怪的杉山高志（内山昂辉 配音）、热衷于看电视猜谜节目的坂口洋平（北泽力 配音）、性格轻浮却异常讨厌烟味的高材生岩仓雪彦（兴津和幸 配音），和阿走共享着这幢破旧的公寓的，是这些性格稀奇古怪的人们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-12 08:36:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/NOp0rQHs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/Go38QvOj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/TtokJZUc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/VnKjfMmY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/6TV55Tbx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/hvMKVkbz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/d6QvUPkM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/p1R0GOmb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/1sjWCZot/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/r5RiO7Ub/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/ifoey13G/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/Wd8LF7wq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/d7lQO9uo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/Oz8TeFac/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/KDMbxnLy/index.m3u8"},{"n